      "message": "I think I prefer \"wait-ext\" for wait external reset. It could be Cr50 generated for instance and not servo.\n\nAdditionally, these flags are informational. Is it necessary to know that we were waiting? The reset cause will be reset-pin.\n\nWhat do you think?",
